@startuml direct-rialto-handshake-injector-first-sequence
title Handshake: a sample arrives before Rialto asks for data
skinparam shadowing false

participant "Injector thread" as INJ
participant "NeedDataHandshake" as HS
participant "Rialto event thread" as EV
participant "IMediaPipeline" as PIPE

INJ -> HS : BeginInject()
note right of HS
  injectorActive = true
  (returns false only if EOS is latched
  and no request is pending)
end note
INJ -> HS : WaitForGate(gen)
HS --> INJ : Proceed (gate is NONE)
INJ -> HS : WaitForRequest(gen)
note right of INJ
  Blocks on the condition variable.
  No timeout by design.  Released only by:
  needData, a gate change to BLOCKED,
  or a generation bump (Flush / Stop).
end note
...
EV -> HS : OnNeedData(N, 7) via handleNeedData()
HS -> INJ : cv.notify_all() (WakeWaiters)
HS --> INJ : Proceed, req=7
INJ -> PIPE : addSegment(7, segment)
PIPE --> INJ : OK
INJ -> HS : Complete(gen, 7, morePending=false, segment)
HS --> INJ : Reply::Ok, injectorActive = false
INJ -> PIPE : haveData(OK, 7)
note over INJ, PIPE
  The inject thread is the back-pressure point: AAMP's
  fragment injection call does not return until Rialto
  has asked for (and been given) this sample.
end note
@enduml
